
#Nathan: Here are some choices.
#- First one
#	Nathan: You picked the first one.
#- Second one
#	Nathan: You picked the second one.
#- Start again => start
#- End the conversation => END
#Nathan: For more information see the online documentation.

~ start
# 레퍼런스: 바이오쇼크, 하프라이프, 폴아웃
# 권위주의적인 정부가 국민을 프로그램의 실험체로 자랑스럽게 포장해서 내보내는 느낌
# 정부: The State, 주인공을 부르는 호칭: HomeSteader
do SoundManager.play_sound(load("res://assets/sounds/radio_noise.mp3"))
The State: [[Greetings|Hello|Salutations]], Citizen!
The State: Congratulations! You have been selected as a Homesteader under Executive Order No. 7 — affectionately known as "The Seven." A plot of unpolluted farmland near {city_name} has been allocated to you.
The State: You're almost there! Just a few more steps, and you'll reach your new home!
The State: Proceed with caution — and pride!
=> END

~ found_corpse
do SoundManager.play_sound(load("res://assets/sounds/radio_noise.mp3"))
The State: Look ahead. A fresh corpse! As a fresh homesteader, you need to use everything to survive.
The State: Press [E] or right click to search that body.


=> END

~ need_weapon
The State: Don't proceed just yet! Go back and check the corpse first!
=> END

# 칼 획득
~ obtained_sword
The State: Now you`re on the right track! A decent sword! Do you see that zombie up ahead? 
The State: Looks docile for now. Just use your new sword and kill it.
=> END

# 좀비 다섯마리
~ zombie_horde
The State: Looks like the path is blocked by zombies... 
The State: You must take a detour to the south. Don't go near them. They can hear you.
=> END

# 아노말리.(밟으면 불기둥 나옴)
~ anomaly
The State: Do you see those flames? According to out intel, this embers keep burning since the disaster.
The State: Think the deeds we can achieve with them...
The State: Well, only we can find out getting your hands dirty. Just step on them and get past it, homesteader.
=> END

~ anomaly_passed
The State: Facsinating! That hole 
# 어노말리 밟음 데미지 입음.
The State: Think we can do wonders studying them. All thanks to you. Homesteader.
=> END

~ house_sighted
The State: Look! A intact house!
The State: Go inside and check loots.
=> END

# 집 - 안으로 들어가기.
~ enter_house
The State: Go inside the house and see what you can find.
=> END

# 집안 - 금고
~ safe
The State: Open that safe and see what's inside.
=> END

# 약 총 획득
~ obtained_medicine
The State: Splendid. You can treat your burn with the medicine. But be careful with the pistol. 
The State: Ranged attack can be good, but that can lure neighboring zombies as well. Use it wisely.
=> END

# 침뱉는 좀비 - 총으로 죽임
~ spitter
The State: This one is called Spitter. Our researchers found they literally spit everything they had before: blood, internal organs...
The State: You don't want to get shot by that. Use your pistol to kill it and proceed.
=> END

# 농장 입구
~ farm_entrance
The State: Good. You arrived. 
The State: Glory to the state.
=> END
